INPUT BEGIN
NEW PTSET /SAMPLE-PTSET
NEW PTAXI
NUMB 1
PAXI -Y
PDIS 100
PBOR 80
PCON BWD
END
NEW PTAXI
NUMB 2
PAXI Y
PDIS 100
PBOR 80
PCON BWD
END
END
OLD PTSET /SAMPLE-PTSET
LOCK
OLD PTAXI 1 OF PTSET /SAMPLE-PTSET
LOCK
OLD PTAXI 2 OF PTSET /SAMPLE-PTSET
LOCK
INPUT END PTSET /SAMPLE-PTSET

INPUT BEGIN
NEW GMSET /SAMPLE-GMSET
NEW SCYLINDER
PAXI -Y
PDIS 100
PDIA 89.1
PHEI -200
OBST 2
TUFL TRUE
CLFL FALSE
END
END
OLD GMSET /SAMPLE-GMSET
LOCK
OLD SCYLINDER 1 OF GMSET /SAMPLE-GMSET
LOCK
INPUT END GMSET /SAMPLE-GMSET

INPUT FINISH
